      "content": "but that's the thing... it's not just a \"tough time.\" it feels permanent. like once that bridge is burned, it's just gone. i see them all laughing and being normal and i realize i'm just a mistake they've all agreed to forget. there's no \"getting better\" from being a social pariah. it just feels like a long, slow death.",
